				<wikidot:authorName>Mumbleskates</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1244803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I should mention that I thought this entire conversation was in typed text until I re-read it. The fold-out full alphabetic keyboard on the 28C was pretty much its greatest feature, and the image of a kid sitting in the back of his class fiddling quietly with his calculator seems much more fitting to me.</p> 
