					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-78954#post-1315154</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-78954/scp-168#post-1315154</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 27 Nov 2011 11:45:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Mumbleskates</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1244803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The HP-28C is not solar powered (it takes N batteries), but it is one of the greatest calculators ever. I started programming on that calculator, and took it with me absolutely everywhere. It was my constant companion for months until it went through the wash, still in my pants pocket.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
